SQL> --17.17. Display all the SALESMEN having 'E' as the second-last character in ENAME and salary with exactly 4 characters.
SQL> SELECT SALESMAN
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE ENAME LIKE '%E_'AND (SAL BETWEEN 1000 AND 9999)ED;
WHERE ENAME LIKE '%E_'AND (SAL BETWEEN 1000 AND 9999)ED
                                                     *
ERROR at line 3:
ORA-00933: SQL command not properly ended 


SQL> ED;
Wrote file afiedt.buf

  1  SELECT ENAME
  2  FROM EMP
  3* WHERE  JOB IN 'SALESMAN' AND ENAME LIKE '%E_'AND (SAL BETWEEN 1000 AND 9999)
SQL> /

ENAME                                                                                               
----------                                                                                          
ALLEN                                                                                               
TURNER  
                                                                                            

