SQL> --2020. List the employees who are not working as MANAGERS and CLERKS in DEPT 10 and 20 with salary between 1000 and 3000.
SQL> SELECT ENAME
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE JOB NOT IN ('MANAGER','CLERK') AND DEPTNO IN (10 ,20) AND SAL BETWEEN 1000 AND 3000;

ENAME                                                                                               
